  <running_head>PARTICIPII</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
    <catchword>V. De</catchword>
    <signature>M 2</signature>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" type="heading" level="1" para="true">DE PARTICIPIO.</l>
    <l n="2" type="heading" level="2" para="true">Et primò</l>
    <l n="3" type="heading" level="2" para="true">
      <i>De Qualitate Participiorum.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4" para="true">
      <i>Participium</i> quoque, ut Verbum, vel</l>
    <l n="5">est activum: ut, τύπτων, γεάφων. Vel pas-</l>
    <l n="6">sivum: ut, τυπτόμενος, γεαφόμενος. Vel</l>
    <l n="7">neutrum: ut, τέχων, υγιαίνων; &amp; subftanti-</l>
    <l n="8">vorum Verborum, ὤν, πέλων, πλέθων. Vel</l>
    <l n="9">deponens: ut, μαχόμενος, γινόμενος. Vel</l>
    <l n="10">medium: ut, πεπτωκώς, γεαψάμενος.</l>
    <l n="11" type="heading" level="2" para="true">
      <i>II. De Specie Participiorum.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12" para="true">Participia omnia sunt à Verbis deri-</l>
    <l n="13">vata: etiam ab Impersonalibus defecti-</l>
    <l n="14">vis. ut: δέον, χρέον, ἐξὸν, πρέπον, ωσθηκὸν.</l>
    <l n="15" type="heading" level="2" para="true">
      <i>III. De Figurâ Participiorum.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16" para="true">Suntque vel simplicia: ut, ὤν, λέγων.</l>
    <l n="17">vel composita: ut, παρὼν, συλλέγων.</l>
    <l n="18" type="heading" level="2" para="true">
      <i>II. De Persona Participiorum.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19" para="true">Participia sunt omnis Personæ; pro</l>
    <l n="20">ratione Pronominis aut Verbi, cum</l>
    <l n="21">quo in oratione junguntur.</l>
  </main_text>
